n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Aoe Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>Creates area: <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(area)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (area)\">Dancing Lights (area)</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Dancing_Lights\"> Area: Dancing Lights </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(area)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (area)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Lights\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Dancing_Lights_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dancing_Lights_(area)\" title=\"Dancing Lights (area)\">Dancing Lights</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Illuminates 9 m (30 ft) radius.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Nightlight\" title=\"Essence of Nightlight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Essence_of_Nightlight_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Nightlight\" title=\"Essence of Nightlight\">Essence of Nightlight</a> (procur